<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<FinalDraft><Content>
  <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="1"><Text>INT. 林晚房间 - NIGHT</Text></Paragraph>
  <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林晚记下姐姐的警告，核对屏幕上的号码。</Text></Paragraph>
  <Paragraph Type="UnsupportedLayout"><Text>作者要求保留林晚主动求证，不替她提前知道真相。</Text></Paragraph>
  <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="2"><Text>INT. 走廊 - NIGHT</Text></Paragraph>
  <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林晚发现线索矛盾，决定出门求证。</Text></Paragraph>
</Content></FinalDraft>
